n't get left behind. @nwlc https:\/\/t.co\/52yJyWoiT7","userId":58878834,"media":null,"username":"sdavidh","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1002209484058628096,"date":1527780335000,"rawContent":"The future of #metoo in the courts requires judges who understand how to correctly interpret the laws. Let\u2019s hope the 4th Circuit reverses this egregiously wrong decision. https:\/\/t.co\/9ewetSyfnM","userId":58878834,"media":null,"username":"sdavidh","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1012700212383580160,"date":1530281520000,"rawContent":"\u201cWe know that for every deposition in sexual harassment cases, the other side tries to attack the character of the women coming forward - calling them crazy. But more and more after #metoo, people are being believed.\u201d #nela18 https:\/\/t.co\/sMFdHsKdiU","userId":58878834,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/Dg3VeCkUYAEa3L7?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"sdavidh","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1012703013666840576,"date":1530282188000,"rawContent":"\u201cThe election led new to energy among 