ning! Come find us! #ustoo #metoo #NN18","userId":58878834,"media":null,"username":"sdavidh","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":26,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1025384058602303489,"date":1533305584000,"rawContent":"What do you wish more people knew about the particular concerns that your community has about sexual violence? #ustoo #metoo #NN18","userId":58878834,"media":null,"username":"sdavidh","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":27,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1025391243961004032,"date":1533307298000,"rawContent":"We can\u2019t continue to assume that men will behave badly as an inevitability. That puts the responsibility on women when it shouldn\u2019t be. #NN18 #ustoo #metoo https:\/\/t.co\/ThrffWZdxp","userId":58878834,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/Djrr5k0XgAEawwy?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"sdavidh","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":28,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1025392342331731968,"date":1533307559000,"rawContent":"Preach and teach yes, but also DO what you\u2019re preaching and teaching. The progressive movement also needs to clean house when it comes to #metoo - @NJDC07 #NN18","userId":58878834,"media":null,"u